      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The jiidon uses their nearly indestructible teeth to chew through even the toughest armor, leaving an opponent vulnerable. The jiidon makes a jaws Strike. On a successful attack, if the target is wearing armor with Hardness 10 or lower, the armor becomes broken. This Strike doesn't further damage armor that's already broken."
